computing/README

This is the source for *Theory of Computing* by Jim Hefferon. 

This source uses LaTeX and related programs.  To install the source
files, see INSTALL.

CONTACT

  jhefferon@smcvt.edu

STATUS

This is a draft.  I used it for a class in 2017 and now will be
using it for a second time this spring.

It is complete in that all the chapters and sections are here,
along with exercises.  But there are things missing, including some planned
Extra sections and some additional development of results.  As in
any draft, there will be errors.

In particular, it is my intention to supplement the text with
programming exercises.  For this I had in mind using Racket or
Chicken Scheme (but Python is not impossible).  I may use Juypter
notebooks.  That material is not written.


HISTORY

